## solution

#### in order traversal

```cpp
#include <vector>

void inOrderTraversal(Node* root, std::vector<int> &vals) {
  if (root == nullptr) {
    return;
  }

  inOrderTraversal(root->left, vals);
  vals.push_back(root->val);
  inOrderTraversal(root->right, vals);
}

bool isBinarySearchTree(Node* root) {
  std::vector<int> vals;
  inOrderTraversal(root, vals);

  for (int i = 0; i < vals.size() - 1; i += 1) {
    if (vals[i] > vals[i + 1]) {
      return false;
    }
  } 

  return true;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
